					'Do not disrupt or misuse the website.',
					'Do not use the content to distribute malware or unlawful material.',
					'Respect copyright, trademarks, and cited sources.',
				],
			},
			{
				title: 'Changes',
				paragraphs: ['Content, links, and these terms may be updated when necessary. Continued use after an update means acceptance of the published version.'],
			},
		],
	},
	{
		slug: 'en/disclaimer',
		title: 'Disclaimer',
		description: 'Limits of responsibility for technical information, software, and external links published by HAKAMIQ.',
